{"id":"133faf740a0bc758","group":"FormalSystem","path":"FormalSystem/578_显式可证性逻辑.md","title":"578 显式可证性逻辑","display":"578_显式可证性逻辑","type":"system","metadata":{},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[],"html":"<p><span class=\"inline-tag\">#FormalSystem</span></p>\n\n<h1 id=\"1.-原始符号\">1. 原始符号</h1>\n<p>令</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathbb N=\\{0,1,2,\\ldots\\},\\quad\n\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(X)=\\{Y\\subseteq X:Y\\text{ 有限}\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathbb N=\\{0,1,2,\\ldots\\},\\quad\n\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(X)=\\{Y\\subseteq X:Y\\text{ 有限}\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Prop}_{578}=\\{p_i:i\\in\\mathbb N\\},\\quad\n\\mathsf{PVar}_{578}=\\{x_i:i\\in\\mathbb N\\},\\quad\n\\mathsf{PConst}_{578}=\\{c_i:i\\in\\mathbb N\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Prop}_{578}=\\{p_i:i\\in\\mathbb N\\},\\quad\n\\mathsf{PVar}_{578}=\\{x_i:i\\in\\mathbb N\\},\\quad\n\\mathsf{PConst}_{578}=\\{c_i:i\\in\\mathbb N\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>证明项构造子为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{pvar},\\operatorname{pconst},\\operatorname{sum},\\operatorname{app},\\operatorname{bang}\">\\(\\operatorname{pvar},\\operatorname{pconst},\\operatorname{sum},\\operatorname{app},\\operatorname{bang}\\)</span>。公式构造子为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{atm},\\operatorname{bot},\\operatorname{neg},\\operatorname{imp},\\operatorname{prov},\\operatorname{prf}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{atm},\\operatorname{bot},\\operatorname{neg},\\operatorname{imp},\\operatorname{prov},\\operatorname{prf}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>显示 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{prov}(A)\">\\(\\operatorname{prov}(A)\\)</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Pr}A\">\\(\\mathsf{Pr}A\\)</span>，显示 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{prf}(t,A)\">\\(\\operatorname{prf}(t,A)\\)</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"t\\triangleright A\">\\(t\\triangleright A\\)</span>，显示 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{bang}(t)\">\\(\\operatorname{bang}(t)\\)</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"!t\">\\(!t\\)</span>。</p>\n<h1 id=\"2.-项与公式\">2. 项与公式</h1>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Term}_{578}\">\\(\\mathsf{Term}_{578}\\)</span> 是满足下列条件的最小集合：</p>\n<ol>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\\in\\mathsf{PVar}_{578}\">\\(x\\in\\mathsf{PVar}_{578}\\)</span> 蕴含 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{pvar}(x)\\in\\mathsf{Term}_{578}\">\\(\\operatorname{pvar}(x)\\in\\mathsf{Term}_{578}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"c\\in\\mathsf{PConst}_{578}\">\\(c\\in\\mathsf{PConst}_{578}\\)</span> 蕴含 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{pconst}(c)\\in\\mathsf{Term}_{578}\">\\(\\operatorname{pconst}(c)\\in\\mathsf{Term}_{578}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"s,t\\in\\mathsf{Term}_{578}\">\\(s,t\\in\\mathsf{Term}_{578}\\)</span> 蕴含 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"s+t\\in\\mathsf{Term}_{578}\">\\(s+t\\in\\mathsf{Term}_{578}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"s,t\\in\\mathsf{Term}_{578}\">\\(s,t\\in\\mathsf{Term}_{578}\\)</span> 蕴含 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"s\\cdot t\\in\\mathsf{Term}_{578}\">\\(s\\cdot t\\in\\mathsf{Term}_{578}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"t\\in\\mathsf{Term}_{578}\">\\(t\\in\\mathsf{Term}_{578}\\)</span> 蕴含 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"!t\\in\\mathsf{Term}_{578}\">\\(!t\\in\\mathsf{Term}_{578}\\)</span>。</li>\n</ol>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Frm}_{578}\">\\(\\mathsf{Frm}_{578}\\)</span> 是满足下列条件的最小集合：</p>\n<ol>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p\\in\\mathsf{Prop}_{578}\">\\(p\\in\\mathsf{Prop}_{578}\\)</span> 蕴含 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{atm}(p)\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{578}\">\\(\\operatorname{atm}(p)\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{578}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\bot\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{578}\">\\(\\bot\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{578}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{578}\">\\(A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{578}\\)</span> 蕴含 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\neg A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{578}\">\\(\\neg A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{578}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{578}\">\\(A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{578}\\)</span> 蕴含 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\to B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{578}\">\\(A\\to B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{578}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{578}\">\\(A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{578}\\)</span> 蕴含 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Pr}A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{578}\">\\(\\mathsf{Pr}A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{578}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"t\\in\\mathsf{Term}_{578}\">\\(t\\in\\mathsf{Term}_{578}\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{578}\">\\(A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{578}\\)</span> 蕴含 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"t\\triangleright A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{578}\">\\(t\\triangleright A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{578}\\)</span>。</li>\n</ol>\n<h1 id=\"3.-自由符号与替换\">3. 自由符号与替换</h1>\n<p>定义自由符号函数</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{PV}_{578}:\\mathsf{Frm}_{578}\\to\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\mathsf{Prop}_{578}),\n\\quad\n\\operatorname{TV}_{578}:\\mathsf{Term}_{578}\\to\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\mathsf{PVar}_{578}),\n\\quad\n\\operatorname{TVF}_{578}:\\mathsf{Frm}_{578}\\to\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\mathsf{PVar}_{578}).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{PV}_{578}:\\mathsf{Frm}_{578}\\to\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\mathsf{Prop}_{578}),\n\\quad\n\\operatorname{TV}_{578}:\\mathsf{Term}_{578}\\to\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\mathsf{PVar}_{578}),\n\\quad\n\\operatorname{TVF}_{578}:\\mathsf{Frm}_{578}\\to\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\mathsf{PVar}_{578}).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>项和公式均无绑定构造子。定义</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{BV}_{578}:\\mathsf{Term}_{578}\\cup\\mathsf{Frm}_{578}\\to\\{\\varnothing\\},\n\\qquad\n\\operatorname{BV}_{578}(U)=\\varnothing.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{BV}_{578}:\\mathsf{Term}_{578}\\cup\\mathsf{Frm}_{578}\\to\\{\\varnothing\\},\n\\qquad\n\\operatorname{BV}_{578}(U)=\\varnothing.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>定义新鲜证明变量函数</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{freshP}_{578}:\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\mathsf{PVar}_{578})\\to\\mathsf{PVar}_{578},\n\\qquad\n\\operatorname{freshP}_{578}(E)=x_m,\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{freshP}_{578}:\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\mathsf{PVar}_{578})\\to\\mathsf{PVar}_{578},\n\\qquad\n\\operatorname{freshP}_{578}(E)=x_m,\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"m=\\min\\{i:x_i\\notin E\\}\">\\(m=\\min\\{i:x_i\\notin E\\}\\)</span>。本函数不参与捕获规避，因为本语言无绑定项构造子。</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{PV}_{578}(\\operatorname{atm}(p))=\\{p\\},\\quad\n\\operatorname{PV}_{578}(\\bot)=\\varnothing,\\quad\n\\operatorname{PV}_{578}(\\neg A)=\\operatorname{PV}_{578}(A),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{PV}_{578}(\\operatorname{atm}(p))=\\{p\\},\\quad\n\\operatorname{PV}_{578}(\\bot)=\\varnothing,\\quad\n\\operatorname{PV}_{578}(\\neg A)=\\operatorname{PV}_{578}(A),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{PV}_{578}(A\\to B)=\\operatorname{PV}_{578}(A)\\cup\\operatorname{PV}_{578}(B),\\quad\n\\operatorname{PV}_{578}(\\mathsf{Pr}A)=\\operatorname{PV}_{578}(A),\\quad\n\\operatorname{PV}_{578}(t\\triangleright A)=\\operatorname{PV}_{578}(A).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{PV}_{578}(A\\to B)=\\operatorname{PV}_{578}(A)\\cup\\operatorname{PV}_{578}(B),\\quad\n\\operatorname{PV}_{578}(\\mathsf{Pr}A)=\\operatorname{PV}_{578}(A),\\quad\n\\operatorname{PV}_{578}(t\\triangleright A)=\\operatorname{PV}_{578}(A).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{TV}_{578}(\\operatorname{pvar}(x))=\\{x\\},\\quad\n\\operatorname{TV}_{578}(\\operatorname{pconst}(c))=\\varnothing,\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{TV}_{578}(\\operatorname{pvar}(x))=\\{x\\},\\quad\n\\operatorname{TV}_{578}(\\operatorname{pconst}(c))=\\varnothing,\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{TV}_{578}(s+t)=\\operatorname{TV}_{578}(s)\\cup\\operatorname{TV}_{578}(t),\\quad\n\\operatorname{TV}_{578}(s\\cdot t)=\\operatorname{TV}_{578}(s)\\cup\\operatorname{TV}_{578}(t),\\quad\n\\operatorname{TV}_{578}(!t)=\\operatorname{TV}_{578}(t).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{TV}_{578}(s+t)=\\operatorname{TV}_{578}(s)\\cup\\operatorname{TV}_{578}(t),\\quad\n\\operatorname{TV}_{578}(s\\cdot t)=\\operatorname{TV}_{578}(s)\\cup\\operatorname{TV}_{578}(t),\\quad\n\\operatorname{TV}_{578}(!t)=\\operatorname{TV}_{578}(t).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{TVF}_{578}(\\operatorname{atm}(p))=\\varnothing,\\quad\n\\operatorname{TVF}_{578}(\\bot)=\\varnothing,\\quad\n\\operatorname{TVF}_{578}(\\neg A)=\\operatorname{TVF}_{578}(A),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{TVF}_{578}(\\operatorname{atm}(p))=\\varnothing,\\quad\n\\operatorname{TVF}_{578}(\\bot)=\\varnothing,\\quad\n\\operatorname{TVF}_{578}(\\neg A)=\\operatorname{TVF}_{578}(A),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{TVF}_{578}(A\\to B)=\\operatorname{TVF}_{578}(A)\\cup\\operatorname{TVF}_{578}(B),\\quad\n\\operatorname{TVF}_{578}(\\mathsf{Pr}A)=\\operatorname{TVF}_{578}(A),\\quad\n\\operatorname{TVF}_{578}(t\\triangleright A)=\\operatorname{TV}_{578}(t)\\cup\\operatorname{TVF}_{578}(A).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{TVF}_{578}(A\\to B)=\\operatorname{TVF}_{578}(A)\\cup\\operatorname{TVF}_{578}(B),\\quad\n\\operatorname{TVF}_{578}(\\mathsf{Pr}A)=\\operatorname{TVF}_{578}(A),\\quad\n\\operatorname{TVF}_{578}(t\\triangleright A)=\\operatorname{TV}_{578}(t)\\cup\\operatorname{TVF}_{578}(A).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>对有限支撑命题替换 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\sigma:\\mathsf{Prop}_{578}\\to\\mathsf{Frm}_{578}\">\\(\\sigma:\\mathsf{Prop}_{578}\\to\\mathsf{Frm}_{578}\\)</span>：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{SubP}_{578}(\\operatorname{atm}(p),\\sigma)=\\sigma(p),\\quad\n\\operatorname{SubP}_{578}(\\bot,\\sigma)=\\bot,\\quad\n\\operatorname{SubP}_{578}(\\neg A,\\sigma)=\\neg\\operatorname{SubP}_{578}(A,\\sigma),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{SubP}_{578}(\\operatorname{atm}(p),\\sigma)=\\sigma(p),\\quad\n\\operatorname{SubP}_{578}(\\bot,\\sigma)=\\bot,\\quad\n\\operatorname{SubP}_{578}(\\neg A,\\sigma)=\\neg\\operatorname{SubP}_{578}(A,\\sigma),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{SubP}_{578}(A\\to B,\\sigma)=\\operatorname{SubP}_{578}(A,\\sigma)\\to\\operatorname{SubP}_{578}(B,\\sigma),\\quad\n\\operatorname{SubP}_{578}(\\mathsf{Pr}A,\\sigma)=\\mathsf{Pr}\\operatorname{SubP}_{578}(A,\\sigma),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{SubP}_{578}(A\\to B,\\sigma)=\\operatorname{SubP}_{578}(A,\\sigma)\\to\\operatorname{SubP}_{578}(B,\\sigma),\\quad\n\\operatorname{SubP}_{578}(\\mathsf{Pr}A,\\sigma)=\\mathsf{Pr}\\operatorname{SubP}_{578}(A,\\sigma),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{SubP}_{578}(t\\triangleright A,\\sigma)=t\\triangleright\\operatorname{SubP}_{578}(A,\\sigma).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{SubP}_{578}(t\\triangleright A,\\sigma)=t\\triangleright\\operatorname{SubP}_{578}(A,\\sigma).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>对有限支撑项替换 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\theta:\\mathsf{PVar}_{578}\\to\\mathsf{Term}_{578}\">\\(\\theta:\\mathsf{PVar}_{578}\\to\\mathsf{Term}_{578}\\)</span>：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{SubT}_{578}(\\operatorname{pvar}(x),\\theta)=\\theta(x),\\quad\n\\operatorname{SubT}_{578}(\\operatorname{pconst}(c),\\theta)=\\operatorname{pconst}(c),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{SubT}_{578}(\\operatorname{pvar}(x),\\theta)=\\theta(x),\\quad\n\\operatorname{SubT}_{578}(\\operatorname{pconst}(c),\\theta)=\\operatorname{pconst}(c),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{SubT}_{578}(s+t,\\theta)=\\operatorname{SubT}_{578}(s,\\theta)+\\operatorname{SubT}_{578}(t,\\theta),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{SubT}_{578}(s+t,\\theta)=\\operatorname{SubT}_{578}(s,\\theta)+\\operatorname{SubT}_{578}(t,\\theta),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{SubT}_{578}(s\\cdot t,\\theta)=\\operatorname{SubT}_{578}(s,\\theta)\\cdot\\operatorname{SubT}_{578}(t,\\theta),\\quad\n\\operatorname{SubT}_{578}(!t,\\theta)=!\\operatorname{SubT}_{578}(t,\\theta),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{SubT}_{578}(s\\cdot t,\\theta)=\\operatorname{SubT}_{578}(s,\\theta)\\cdot\\operatorname{SubT}_{578}(t,\\theta),\\quad\n\\operatorname{SubT}_{578}(!t,\\theta)=!\\operatorname{SubT}_{578}(t,\\theta),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{SubJ}_{578}(\\operatorname{atm}(p),\\theta)=\\operatorname{atm}(p),\\quad\n\\operatorname{SubJ}_{578}(\\bot,\\theta)=\\bot,\\quad\n\\operatorname{SubJ}_{578}(\\neg A,\\theta)=\\neg\\operatorname{SubJ}_{578}(A,\\theta),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{SubJ}_{578}(\\operatorname{atm}(p),\\theta)=\\operatorname{atm}(p),\\quad\n\\operatorname{SubJ}_{578}(\\bot,\\theta)=\\bot,\\quad\n\\operatorname{SubJ}_{578}(\\neg A,\\theta)=\\neg\\operatorname{SubJ}_{578}(A,\\theta),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{SubJ}_{578}(A\\to B,\\theta)=\\operatorname{SubJ}_{578}(A,\\theta)\\to\\operatorname{SubJ}_{578}(B,\\theta),\\quad\n\\operatorname{SubJ}_{578}(\\mathsf{Pr}A,\\theta)=\\mathsf{Pr}\\operatorname{SubJ}_{578}(A,\\theta),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{SubJ}_{578}(A\\to B,\\theta)=\\operatorname{SubJ}_{578}(A,\\theta)\\to\\operatorname{SubJ}_{578}(B,\\theta),\\quad\n\\operatorname{SubJ}_{578}(\\mathsf{Pr}A,\\theta)=\\mathsf{Pr}\\operatorname{SubJ}_{578}(A,\\theta),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{SubJ}_{578}(t\\triangleright A,\\theta)=\\operatorname{SubT}_{578}(t,\\theta)\\triangleright\\operatorname{SubJ}_{578}(A,\\theta).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{SubJ}_{578}(t\\triangleright A,\\theta)=\\operatorname{SubT}_{578}(t,\\theta)\\triangleright\\operatorname{SubJ}_{578}(A,\\theta).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>捕获规避重命名恒为恒等操作；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\equiv_{\\alpha,578}\">\\(\\equiv_{\\alpha,578}\\)</span> 为构造树相等。</p>\n<h1 id=\"4.-公理族\">4. 公理族</h1>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{C1}^{578}=\\{A\\to(B\\to A):A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{578}\\},\n\\quad\n\\mathsf{Ax}_{C2}^{578}=\\{(A\\to(B\\to C))\\to((A\\to B)\\to(A\\to C)):A,B,C\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{578}\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{C1}^{578}=\\{A\\to(B\\to A):A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{578}\\},\n\\quad\n\\mathsf{Ax}_{C2}^{578}=\\{(A\\to(B\\to C))\\to((A\\to B)\\to(A\\to C)):A,B,C\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{578}\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{C3}^{578}=\\{((\\neg A\\to\\neg B)\\to(B\\to A)):A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{578}\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{C3}^{578}=\\{((\\neg A\\to\\neg B)\\to(B\\to A)):A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{578}\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{PrK}^{578}=\\{\\mathsf{Pr}(A\\to B)\\to(\\mathsf{Pr}A\\to\\mathsf{Pr}B):A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{578}\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{PrK}^{578}=\\{\\mathsf{Pr}(A\\to B)\\to(\\mathsf{Pr}A\\to\\mathsf{Pr}B):A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{578}\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{Pr4}^{578}=\\{\\mathsf{Pr}A\\to\\mathsf{Pr}(\\mathsf{Pr}A):A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{578}\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{Pr4}^{578}=\\{\\mathsf{Pr}A\\to\\mathsf{Pr}(\\mathsf{Pr}A):A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{578}\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{ExplApp}^{578}=\\{s\\triangleright(A\\to B)\\to(t\\triangleright A\\to(s\\cdot t)\\triangleright B):s,t\\in\\mathsf{Term}_{578},A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{578}\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{ExplApp}^{578}=\\{s\\triangleright(A\\to B)\\to(t\\triangleright A\\to(s\\cdot t)\\triangleright B):s,t\\in\\mathsf{Term}_{578},A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{578}\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{ExplCheck}^{578}=\\{t\\triangleright A\\to !t\\triangleright(t\\triangleright A):t\\in\\mathsf{Term}_{578},A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{578}\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{ExplCheck}^{578}=\\{t\\triangleright A\\to !t\\triangleright(t\\triangleright A):t\\in\\mathsf{Term}_{578},A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{578}\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{ExplProv}^{578}=\\{t\\triangleright A\\to\\mathsf{Pr}A:t\\in\\mathsf{Term}_{578},A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{578}\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{ExplProv}^{578}=\\{t\\triangleright A\\to\\mathsf{Pr}A:t\\in\\mathsf{Term}_{578},A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{578}\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{AxBase}_{578}\n=\n\\mathsf{Ax}_{C1}^{578}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{C2}^{578}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{C3}^{578}\n\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{PrK}^{578}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{Pr4}^{578}\n\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{ExplApp}^{578}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{ExplCheck}^{578}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{ExplProv}^{578}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{AxBase}_{578}\n=\n\\mathsf{Ax}_{C1}^{578}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{C2}^{578}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{C3}^{578}\n\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{PrK}^{578}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{Pr4}^{578}\n\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{ExplApp}^{578}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{ExplCheck}^{578}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{ExplProv}^{578}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{CS}_{578}\\subseteq\\{c\\triangleright A:c\\in\\mathsf{PConst}_{578},A\\in\\mathsf{AxBase}_{578}\\},\n\\quad\n\\mathsf{Ax}_{578}=\\mathsf{AxBase}_{578}\\cup\\mathsf{CS}_{578}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{CS}_{578}\\subseteq\\{c\\triangleright A:c\\in\\mathsf{PConst}_{578},A\\in\\mathsf{AxBase}_{578}\\},\n\\quad\n\\mathsf{Ax}_{578}=\\mathsf{AxBase}_{578}\\cup\\mathsf{CS}_{578}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h1 id=\"5.-推理规则\">5. 推理规则</h1>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Rule}_{MP}^{578}=\\{((A,A\\to B),B):A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{578}\\},\n\\quad\n\\mathsf{Rule}_{NecPr}^{578}=\\{((A),\\mathsf{Pr}A):A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{578}\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Rule}_{MP}^{578}=\\{((A,A\\to B),B):A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{578}\\},\n\\quad\n\\mathsf{Rule}_{NecPr}^{578}=\\{((A),\\mathsf{Pr}A):A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{578}\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h1 id=\"6.-证明对象\">6. 证明对象</h1>\n<p>对 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma\\subseteq\\mathsf{Frm}_{578}\">\\(\\Gamma\\subseteq\\mathsf{Frm}_{578}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Proof}_{578}(\\Gamma)\">\\(\\mathsf{Proof}_{578}(\\Gamma)\\)</span> 是所有非空有限序列 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"((\\Delta_i,A_i))_{i&lt;m}\">\\(((\\Delta_i,A_i))_{i&lt;m}\\)</span>，满足 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"m&gt;0\">\\(m&gt;0\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Delta_i\\in\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\Gamma)\">\\(\\Delta_i\\in\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\Gamma)\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A_i\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{578}\">\\(A_i\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{578}\\)</span>，且每个 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"i&lt;m\">\\(i&lt;m\\)</span> 满足：</p>\n<ol>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A_i\\in\\Gamma\">\\(A_i\\in\\Gamma\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Delta_i=\\{A_i\\}\">\\(\\Delta_i=\\{A_i\\}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A_i\\in\\mathsf{AxBase}_{578}\">\\(A_i\\in\\mathsf{AxBase}_{578}\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Delta_i=\\varnothing\">\\(\\Delta_i=\\varnothing\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A_i\\in\\mathsf{CS}_{578}\">\\(A_i\\in\\mathsf{CS}_{578}\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Delta_i=\\varnothing\">\\(\\Delta_i=\\varnothing\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>存在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"j,k&lt;i\">\\(j,k&lt;i\\)</span> 使 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"((A_j,A_k),A_i)\\in\\mathsf{Rule}_{MP}^{578}\">\\(((A_j,A_k),A_i)\\in\\mathsf{Rule}_{MP}^{578}\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Delta_i=\\Delta_j\\cup\\Delta_k\">\\(\\Delta_i=\\Delta_j\\cup\\Delta_k\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>存在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"j&lt;i\">\\(j&lt;i\\)</span> 使 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"((A_j),A_i)\\in\\mathsf{Rule}_{NecPr}^{578}\">\\(((A_j),A_i)\\in\\mathsf{Rule}_{NecPr}^{578}\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Delta_j=\\Delta_i=\\varnothing\">\\(\\Delta_j=\\Delta_i=\\varnothing\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>存在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"j&lt;i\">\\(j&lt;i\\)</span> 使 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A_j\\equiv_{\\alpha,578}A_i\">\\(A_j\\equiv_{\\alpha,578}A_i\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Delta_i=\\Delta_j\">\\(\\Delta_i=\\Delta_j\\)</span>。</li>\n</ol>\n<h1 id=\"7.-可证性\">7. 可证性</h1>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma\\vdash_{578}A\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\exists m&gt;0\\ \\exists ((\\Delta_i,A_i))_{i&lt;m}\\in\\mathsf{Proof}_{578}(\\Gamma)\\ (A_{m-1}=A).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\Gamma\\vdash_{578}A\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\exists m&gt;0\\ \\exists ((\\Delta_i,A_i))_{i&lt;m}\\in\\mathsf{Proof}_{578}(\\Gamma)\\ (A_{m-1}=A).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h1 id=\"8.-显式可证性证书\">8. 显式可证性证书</h1>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"578\">\\(578\\)</span>-证书为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(Q,t,A,B)\">\\((Q,t,A,B)\\)</span>，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Q\\in\\{PrK,Pr4,ExplApp,ExplCheck,ExplProv\\}\">\\(Q\\in\\{PrK,Pr4,ExplApp,ExplCheck,ExplProv\\}\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Q=ExplProv\">\\(Q=ExplProv\\)</span> 时输出 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"t\\triangleright A\\to\\mathsf{Pr}A\">\\(t\\triangleright A\\to\\mathsf{Pr}A\\)</span>，该族把显式证明断言送入隐式可证性断言。</p>\n<h1 id=\"9.-目标区分\">9. 目标区分</h1>\n<p>本条目同时含隐式可证性构造子 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Pr}\">\\(\\mathsf{Pr}\\)</span> 与显式证明断言 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"t\\triangleright A\">\\(t\\triangleright A\\)</span>，并通过 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{ExplProv}^{578}\">\\(\\mathsf{Ax}_{ExplProv}^{578}\\)</span> 连接二者；它不是只有 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"t:A\">\\(t:A\\)</span> 的 justification logic。</p>\n<h1 id=\"10.-Kripke-证据语义载体与后承\">10. Kripke-证据语义载体与后承</h1>\n<p>显式可证性原始模型集合为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{PERaw}_{578}\n=\n\\{(W,R,E,V):W\\ne\\varnothing,\\ R\\subseteq W\\times W,\\ \\operatorname{Trans}_{578}(W,R),\\ E:W\\times\\mathsf{Term}_{578}\\to\\mathcal P(\\mathsf{Frm}_{578}),\\ V:\\mathsf{Prop}_{578}\\to\\mathcal P(W)\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{PERaw}_{578}\n=\n\\{(W,R,E,V):W\\ne\\varnothing,\\ R\\subseteq W\\times W,\\ \\operatorname{Trans}_{578}(W,R),\\ E:W\\times\\mathsf{Term}_{578}\\to\\mathcal P(\\mathsf{Frm}_{578}),\\ V:\\mathsf{Prop}_{578}\\to\\mathcal P(W)\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>其中</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Trans}_{578}(W,R)\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\forall u,v,z\\in W\\ ((u,v)\\in R\\wedge(v,z)\\in R\\Rightarrow(u,z)\\in R).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Trans}_{578}(W,R)\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\forall u,v,z\\in W\\ ((u,v)\\in R\\wedge(v,z)\\in R\\Rightarrow(u,z)\\in R).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M=(W,R,E,V)\\in\\mathsf{PERaw}_{578}\">\\(M=(W,R,E,V)\\in\\mathsf{PERaw}_{578}\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"w\\in W\">\\(w\\in W\\)</span>，满足关系递归定义为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"M,w\\models_{578}\\operatorname{atm}(p)\\Longleftrightarrow w\\in V(p),\n\\qquad\nM,w\\not\\models_{578}\\bot,\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[M,w\\models_{578}\\operatorname{atm}(p)\\Longleftrightarrow w\\in V(p),\n\\qquad\nM,w\\not\\models_{578}\\bot,\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"M,w\\models_{578}\\neg A\\Longleftrightarrow \\neg(M,w\\models_{578}A),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[M,w\\models_{578}\\neg A\\Longleftrightarrow \\neg(M,w\\models_{578}A),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"M,w\\models_{578}A\\to B\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\neg(M,w\\models_{578}A)\\ \\vee\\ M,w\\models_{578}B,\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[M,w\\models_{578}A\\to B\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\neg(M,w\\models_{578}A)\\ \\vee\\ M,w\\models_{578}B,\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"M,w\\models_{578}\\mathsf{Pr}A\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\forall v\\in W\\ ((w,v)\\in R\\Rightarrow M,v\\models_{578}A),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[M,w\\models_{578}\\mathsf{Pr}A\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\forall v\\in W\\ ((w,v)\\in R\\Rightarrow M,v\\models_{578}A),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"M,w\\models_{578}t\\triangleright A\n\\Longleftrightarrow\nA\\in E(w,t).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[M,w\\models_{578}t\\triangleright A\n\\Longleftrightarrow\nA\\in E(w,t).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>证据闭包条件为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{EApp}_{578}(M)\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\forall w,s,t,A,B\\ \n\\bigl(A\\to B\\in E(w,s)\\wedge A\\in E(w,t)\\Rightarrow B\\in E(w,s\\cdot t)\\bigr),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{EApp}_{578}(M)\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\forall w,s,t,A,B\\ \n\\bigl(A\\to B\\in E(w,s)\\wedge A\\in E(w,t)\\Rightarrow B\\in E(w,s\\cdot t)\\bigr),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{EBang}_{578}(M)\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\forall w,t,A\\ \\bigl(A\\in E(w,t)\\Rightarrow t\\triangleright A\\in E(w,!t)\\bigr),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{EBang}_{578}(M)\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\forall w,t,A\\ \\bigl(A\\in E(w,t)\\Rightarrow t\\triangleright A\\in E(w,!t)\\bigr),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{EProv}_{578}(M)\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\forall w,t,A\\ \\bigl(A\\in E(w,t)\\Rightarrow \\forall v\\in W\\ ((w,v)\\in R\\Rightarrow M,v\\models_{578}A)\\bigr),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{EProv}_{578}(M)\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\forall w,t,A\\ \\bigl(A\\in E(w,t)\\Rightarrow \\forall v\\in W\\ ((w,v)\\in R\\Rightarrow M,v\\models_{578}A)\\bigr),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{ECS}_{578}(M)\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\forall w\\in W\\ \\forall A\\in\\mathsf{CS}_{578}\\ (M,w\\models_{578}A).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{ECS}_{578}(M)\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\forall w\\in W\\ \\forall A\\in\\mathsf{CS}_{578}\\ (M,w\\models_{578}A).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>显式可证性模型集合为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{PEMod}_{578}\n=\n\\{M\\in\\mathsf{PERaw}_{578}:\n\\operatorname{EApp}_{578}(M)\\wedge\n\\operatorname{EBang}_{578}(M)\\wedge\n\\operatorname{EProv}_{578}(M)\\wedge\n\\operatorname{ECS}_{578}(M)\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{PEMod}_{578}\n=\n\\{M\\in\\mathsf{PERaw}_{578}:\n\\operatorname{EApp}_{578}(M)\\wedge\n\\operatorname{EBang}_{578}(M)\\wedge\n\\operatorname{EProv}_{578}(M)\\wedge\n\\operatorname{ECS}_{578}(M)\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>语义后承定义为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma\\models_{578}^{\\mathsf{pe}}A\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\Gamma\\models_{578}^{\\mathsf{pe}}A\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>当且仅当对所有 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M=(W,R,E,V)\\in\\mathsf{PEMod}_{578}\">\\(M=(W,R,E,V)\\in\\mathsf{PEMod}_{578}\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"w\\in W\">\\(w\\in W\\)</span>，若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\forall B\\in\\Gamma\\ (M,w\\models_{578}B)\">\\(\\forall B\\in\\Gamma\\ (M,w\\models_{578}B)\\)</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M,w\\models_{578}A\">\\(M,w\\models_{578}A\\)</span>。</p>\n<h1 id=\"11.-整个形式系统\">11. 整个形式系统</h1>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal{EPL}_{578}\n=\n\\bigl(\n\\mathsf{Prop}_{578},\\mathsf{PVar}_{578},\\mathsf{PConst}_{578},\n\\mathsf{Term}_{578},\\mathsf{Frm}_{578},\\operatorname{PV}_{578},\\operatorname{TV}_{578},\\operatorname{TVF}_{578},\n\\operatorname{BV}_{578},\\operatorname{freshP}_{578},\n\\operatorname{SubP}_{578},\\operatorname{SubT}_{578},\\operatorname{SubJ}_{578},\\equiv_{\\alpha,578},\n\\mathsf{CS}_{578},\\mathsf{Ax}_{578},\\mathsf{Rule}_{MP}^{578},\\mathsf{Rule}_{NecPr}^{578},\\mathsf{Proof}_{578},\\vdash_{578},\n\\operatorname{Trans}_{578},\\mathsf{PERaw}_{578},\\mathsf{PEMod}_{578},\\models_{578},\\models_{578}^{\\mathsf{pe}}\n\\bigr).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathcal{EPL}_{578}\n=\n\\bigl(\n\\mathsf{Prop}_{578},\\mathsf{PVar}_{578},\\mathsf{PConst}_{578},\n\\mathsf{Term}_{578},\\mathsf{Frm}_{578},\\operatorname{PV}_{578},\\operatorname{TV}_{578},\\operatorname{TVF}_{578},\n\\operatorname{BV}_{578},\\operatorname{freshP}_{578},\n\\operatorname{SubP}_{578},\\operatorname{SubT}_{578},\\operatorname{SubJ}_{578},\\equiv_{\\alpha,578},\n\\mathsf{CS}_{578},\\mathsf{Ax}_{578},\\mathsf{Rule}_{MP}^{578},\\mathsf{Rule}_{NecPr}^{578},\\mathsf{Proof}_{578},\\vdash_{578},\n\\operatorname{Trans}_{578},\\mathsf{PERaw}_{578},\\mathsf{PEMod}_{578},\\models_{578},\\models_{578}^{\\mathsf{pe}}\n\\bigr).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>该系统含显式可证性逻辑的句法、公理、规则、证明对象、可证性、Kripke 可证性语义、证据模型和语义后承；不含算术解释、固定点定理或可靠性证明。</p>\